{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214030/extras/95104bab4e0c6a4239d443cd0fd24865.webp?t=1749156502\" width=650 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through unique arcade style challenges that will test your aim in all aspects. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard training modes will perfect all your skills from accuracy and speed to tracking and flicking. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Scoring System will reward good habits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rating System for completed challenges assigns a rating based on your performance. Everyone wants to see that Diamond rating. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaderboards displaying the best Aimers and their score in each game mode. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements are ready to be collected at every corner.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214030/extras/d0176c9e3826db97ddddd173aa84a422.poster.avif?t=1749156502\" width=650 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214030/extras/d0176c9e3826db97ddddd173aa84a422.webm?t=1749156502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Aim Expert is a skill based aiming simulator providing arcade style levels and standard aim training modes. Challenge yourself in all aspects of aiming and climb the leaderboards to showcase your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214030/extras/c71d7533a7df02b17035f2981e660e24.webp?t=1749156502\" width=650 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a challenging journey that will test but also sharpen your aiming skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214030/extras/59fbc90306aa2096649b42aa9bf1c915.poster.avif?t=1749156502\" width=650 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214030/extras/59fbc90306aa2096649b42aa9bf1c915.webm?t=1749156502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214030/extras/07f0ed9a13f6634a32fceceab80d4e0e.webp?t=1749156502\" width=650 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win or fail, it doesn't matter. Regular exercise of an activity or skill is the way to become proficient in it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214030/extras/8783a7e2719a46acb3fb0de48bab9c7c.poster.avif?t=1749156502\" width=650 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214030/extras/8783a7e2719a46acb3fb0de48bab9c7c.webm?t=1749156502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're looking to have fun, trying to get a high score or take your aim to the next level, Aim Expert has something for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214030/extras/bf90a17bb0e4a7b91596f1cbbca7c1f1.webp?t=1749156502\" width=650 height=30 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Target Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2214030/cfb52f289e6f6e209f52be3425d711d459c98b56.jpg"},{"name":"10 Targets Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2214030/9bf4b4dfa0fc038368e31f185573bf6883123a11.jpg"},{"name":"100 Targets Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2214030/21a22395c14084aae8de09f62905876ea45d0e04.jpg"},{"name":"1000 Targets Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2214030/a94c04072cf50c9cf05e6b95c569dab633454480.jpg"},{"name":"10000 Targets Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2214030/1156525518cc7c3fcc8146cec57c3cb113d0caf6.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 1 Training Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2214030/8fa0376ab565c084c7053fd5212379fc57852e91.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 10 Training Modes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2214030/594850e2b8fda644f6ce031e5c089efa633d9efa.jpg"},{"name":"Complete 100 Training Modes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2214030/00f425d41f1f10c13073caaea14cd0d276670588.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Aimer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2214030/0cf5591551d84618a1c6c13047f5d15a13f511f1.jpg"},{"name":"It Only Gets Better","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2214030/4c24c7597da1d6f7a280d6518106821f98aca694.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2214030?t=1749156502","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2214030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749156502","capsule_image":"htt